  "title": "Celebrating 40 Years of the Nasdaq-100 Index® (NDX®)",
  "summary": "--Nasdaq, Inc. proudly marks the 40th anniversary of the Nasdaq-100 Index ®, the world’ s preeminent large-cap growth benchmark. The Nasdaq-100 Index ® tracks 100 of the largest, non-financial companies listed on the Nasdaq Stock Market. As of December 31, 2024, the median market capitalization of a company in the NDX ® was $74 billion, and the average market...",
